   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Erikson’s theory of psychosocial development states that identity development is crucial before a person can achieve true intimacy in relationships. In your essay, explain how identity and intimacy are interconnected during early adulthood. Use examples from your own experience or observations of others to illustrate how the development of a strong sense of self can impact the ability to form intimate relationships.",
